{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"ramp-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"ramp-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["ramp-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk rasio kemiringan ZXQPH0000QXZ:N, kalikan kenaikan vertikal dengan N untuk memperkirakan jalan horizontal. Permukaan miring adalah hipotenusa dari kenaikan dan jalan. Sebagai contoh, kenaikan ZXQPH0001QXZ m pada ZXQPH0002QXZ:ZXQPH0003QXZ membutuhkan ZXQPH0004QXZ m jalan horizontal sebelum mendarat.","record_id":"3d9493f67a173b2b7915824a5a0a09862e362f8104be6f1be02f88175ab7d73a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":1.2082671778749727,"source":"For a 1:N slope ratio, multiply the vertical rise by N to estimate horizontal run. The sloped surface is the hypotenuse of rise and run. For example, a 1 m rise at 1:12 needs 12 m of horizontal run before landings.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"5932b8c60cf5cd24b709b1365275f3ec10dbc6c0a4e96a85fb565d5230f07937","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk rasio kemiringan 1:N, kalikan kenaikan vertikal dengan N untuk memperkirakan jalan horizontal. Permukaan miring adalah hipotenusa dari kenaikan dan jalan. Sebagai contoh, kenaikan 1 m pada 1:12 membutuhkan 12 m jalan horizontal sebelum mendarat.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
